// v1.0 message-store, buffers them in Neon, and forwards them idempotently to
// the on-prem SQL Server (system of record). The cloud `Message` row is a
// transient idempotency buffer — body purged 72h after forward, row deleted at
// 30 days. Mirrors the domain `messaging` bounded context (packages/domain).
//
// All models additive / expand-only. tenantId is the 2nd field on every model
// so the schema-sync regex in prisma-tenant-isolation.test.ts captures it.
// ===========================================================================

enum MessageDirection {
